# Zillow Home Price Prediction

## Situation

Built a machine learning model to predict home prices.

## Challenge

Forward-filled missing data created unrealistic housing prices.

## Action

Investigated the anomaly.

Found one town's values had been forward-filled for several years.

Limited forward filling to six months.

Added a minimum transaction threshold.

## Result

Model accuracy improved to approximately 83%.

## Lessons Learned

Data preparation often has a greater impact than model selection.